# Build context is the repository root (see apps/web/Dockerfile). Everything
# the image does not need is excluded here - not only to keep the context
# small, but because .env* and kubeconfigs must never reach a layer.

# Secrets and local configuration. The leading ** matters: .env.local lives in
# apps/web, not at the root.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/kubeconfig
**/.kube/

# Dependencies and build output - reinstalled and rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# .NET (the rig agent and the spike recorder are win-x64 and are never
# containerized - see docs/platform/local-kubernetes.md).
**/bin/
**/obj/
apps/rig-agent/
spike/
spike-logs/

# Repository furniture with no place in an image.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.coderabbit.yaml
deploy/
docs/
**/*.md

# OS / editor
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.vercel
